  - name: Reuters Net Down
    detail: Reuters is unreachable
    fluxfile: flux/reuters_net_down.flux
    severity: 1
    threshold: 0
    calendar: OfficeHours
    comparison: gt
    tags: 
      - host
      - _field
      - _measurement
      - server
      - port 
      - service
    interval: 300
    target: xapi
    action: | 
              This alert indicates that several attempts to connect by TCP to the endpoint in the details failed. This may be a
              temporary problem but connectivity should be verified manually. Extended outages should be escalated to Azure
              Network Support and/or the client. Reuters is reached through the CIBC network and may indicate a more serious loss 
              of connectivity. 
